      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "1) If a card does damage damage to multiple targets, do you have to deal that damage?  i.e. Ball lightning where you might not want to deal lightning damage to a particular target.\n\n2)  With an ongoing card that does damage at the start of a turn, can you choose not to deal that damage?  Our example is Impale played on Baron Blade when he has his Elemental Redistributer engaged - we'd prefer not to deal the cold damage as it would kill our weakest hero",
